\v 30 “\add ≈However,\add* Heshbon's¦82660 King¦82659 Sihon¦82658 wouldn't let¦82661 us¦82661 go through \add his country\add* because¦82663 your¦82667 god¦82667 Yahweh¦82666 had¦82671 hardened his spirit¦82670 and¦82656 \add ≈made¦82671 him¦82676 stubborn¦82665\add* so¦82675 that¦82679 you \add ≈could take his land\add*, \add which we still have\add* to¦82676 this¦82679 day¦82678.
