\v 6 We¦82922 completely¦82922 destroyed¦82922 them¦82923 like we'd done¦82925 to¦82926 Heshbon's¦82928 King¦82927 Sihon¦82926—men, women¦82934, and¦82922 children¦82935,
\v 7 but¦82937 we¦82942 plundered¦82942 all¦82937 the cattle¦82939 and¦82940 the spoil¦82940 from the cities¦82941 for¦82943 ourselves.
