\v 11 (Bashan's¦82999 King¦82998 Og¦82997 \add ≈was the last king¦82998 who was a descendant\add* of the Refaites¦83002. His¦83004 bed (in Rabbah¦83009 in the Ammonite¦83011 region) was made out of iron¦83006 and was \add ≈four¦83015 metres\add* long and \add ≈two metres\add* wide¦83017.)
