\v 12 “\add ≈So¦83022\add* we¦83026 \add ≈captured\add* that land¦83024 at¦83027 that time¦83027—from Aroer¦83029 by the Arnon¦83035 river, and half¦83036 of the hill¦83037 country¦83037 of Gilead¦83039 including¦83036 its¦83040 cities¦83040. I¦83041 \add ≈allocated\add* \add those areas\add* to¦83042 the \add ≈tribes of Reuven and Gad\add*.
