\p
\v 18 “Then¦83139 at¦83141 that¦83151 time¦83141, I commanded¦83139 you saying¦83143, ‘Your god¦83145 Yahweh¦83144 has¦83146 given¦83146 this¦83151 land¦83150 to you to possess¦83152 it¦83152, \add however\add* \add ≈your brave warriors\add* must¦83154 cross¦83154 over¦83154 \add ≈with¦83141 the other Israeli¦83157 tribes\add* \add to help them conquer the western lands\add*.\x + \xo 3:18-20: \xt Josh 1:12-15.\x*
