\v 20 until¦83182 Yahweh gives \add ≈peace\add* to your brother¦83188 tribes like¦83189 you have¦83208 \add here\add*. \add ≈Once\add* they've taken¦83190 possession¦83206 of¦83190 the land¦83196 that your god¦83199 Yahweh is¦83200 given¦83208 them¦83201 across¦83202 the river, then you'll all be able to return¦83204 her to your own¦83206 inheritance that I've¦83208 \add ≈allocated\add* to you.’
