\v 21 “I¦83214 \add ≈also¦83211\add* instructed¦83214 Yehoshua¦83213 \add !(Joshua¦83213)\add* at¦83215 that time¦83215, saying¦83217, ‘\add ≈You've\add* seen¦83219 everything that your¦83218 god¦83226 Yahweh has done to those¦83229 two¦83227 kings¦83228. Yahweh will¦83232 do¦83232 \add ≈similar things\add* to all¦83234 the¦83236 kingdoms¦83236 that you'll be passing¦83239 through \add over\add* there¦83240.
