\v 26 “\add ≈But¦83306\add* Yahweh was¦83306 angry¦83306 at¦83308 me because¦83309 of¦83309 \add ≈what your parents had done¦83319\add*, and¦83306 he¦83311 wouldn't listen¦83311 to me. \add ≈Instead,\add* Yahweh told me, ‘Enough¦83316 from you—don't¦83310 talk to me about¦83309 that¦83326 again¦83324!
