\p
\v 1 “Now¦83378 Yisrael¦83379, listen¦83380 to¦83381 the instructions¦83383 and regulations¦83383 that I'll¦83388 teach¦83389 you so¦83392 that you'll all go¦83394 and possess¦83395 the land¦83398 that Yahweh¦83400, the god¦83401 of¦83401 your ancestors¦83402, is¦83403 giving¦83403 you, and live¦83393 there.
