\v 3 You've all seen¦83430 \add ≈for¦83438 yourselves\add* what your¦83451 god¦83450 Yahweh¦83435 did¦83434 at¦83436 Beyt-Peor¦83447, when he¦83434 destroyed¦83448 all the¦83441 men¦83441 who¦83442 \add ≈worshipped\add* \add Baal\add* there.\x + \xo 4:3: \xt Num 25:1-9.\x*
\v 4 \add ≈However,\add* all¦83458 of¦83456 you¦83458 who¦83454 \add ≈faithfully continued to follow\add* your¦83458 god¦83456 Yahweh¦83455 are¦83457 alive¦83457 \add here\add* today.
