\v 5 “\add ≈Listen\add*, I've¦83463 taught¦83463 you all the instructions¦83468 and regulations¦83465 that my¦83470 god¦83470 Yahweh¦83469 commanded¦83468 me¦83468 to, for¦83471 you all to \add ≈follow\add* in¦83473 the land¦83474 that you're about¦83477 to \add ≈enter and occupy\add*.
