\v 8 \add ≈Also¦83527,\add* what other nation¦83528 has rules and regulations¦83533 that are as \add ≈sensible and fair\add* as these instructions¦83533 that I'm¦83540 giving to¦83532 you all¦83536 today?
\p
\v 9 “\add ≈But¦83548\add* \add each of you must\add* take¦83546 care to guard¦83548 yourself¦83547 and your \add ≈values\add* in case you forget¦83553 that you've seen¦83559 and \add those past miracles\add* \add ≈slip from¦83564 your minds over the¦83556 years to come\add*. \add Yes,\add* \add ≈make¦83568 sure that you teach them¦83568 to your children and your grand-children\add*,
\v 10 \add including\add* the day¦83573 when you¦83575 stood¦83575 \add ≈in¦83579 our god¦83578 Yahweh's¦83577 presence\add* at¦83579 \add Mt. Sinai\add* (Horev¦83579) when \add *he\add* told me, ‘Assemble¦83583 the people¦83588 for me, and I'll make¦83589 \add it so they can\add* hear¦83589 my¦83592 words¦83592, so they'll¦83594 learn¦83594 to \add ≈honour and respect for their entire¦83597 lifetimes,\add* and then teach¦83609 it to their children¦83608.’
\p
\v 11 “\add ≈So¦83611\add* you all approached the mountain and¦83611 stood¦83612 \add ≈at¦83617 its base\add* while it blazed with fire¦83617 that went¦83611 up into the \add ≈atmosphere\add* \add even though\add* the mountain was¦83616 covered with dark¦83622, gloomy clouds¦83623.\x + \xo 4:11-12: \xt Exo 19:16-18; Heb 12:18-19.\x*
\v 12 Then¦83626 Yahweh¦83627 spoke¦83626 to¦83628 you from¦83629 the middle¦83629 of¦83629 the flames¦83630—you heard¦83634 \add ≈the voice¦83639 even though you couldn't see¦83637 anyone\add*,
\v 13 and¦83641 he \add ≈revealed\add* to¦83642 you the agreement¦83645 that he \add ≈demands\add* you keep: the ten¦83650 commands¦83651 that he wrote¦83652 onto two¦83655 stone¦83657 tablets¦83656.\x + \xo 4:13: \xt Exo 31:18; 34:28; Deu 9:10.\x*
\v 14 At¦83662 that time¦83662, Yahweh¦83661 told¦83660 me¦83659 to teach¦83664 you all the instructions¦83660 and regulations¦83666 so you'd be¦83673 able to \add ≈put them¦83669 into practice\add* in¦83662 the land that you're \add ≈about¦83673 to enter and occupy\add*.\x + \xo 4:14: \xt Exo 21:1.\x*
\s1 Warnings about false gods
\rem /s1 Idolatry Forbidden; A Warning against Idolatry; Warning against Idolatry
\p
\v 15 \add ≈Now remembering that\add* you didn't¦83681 see¦83682 any¦83683 form¦83685 at¦83690 \add Mt. Sinai\add* (Horev¦83690) when¦83687 Yahweh¦83688 spoke¦83687 to¦83689 you all from¦83691 the middle¦83691 of¦83691 the fire¦83692,
\v 16 \add ≈so don't corrupt¦83696 yourselves\add* by making an¦83699 idol¦83699 \add to be your god\add*—don't make¦83697 anything in the likeness¦83704 of¦83700 a man or¦83706 a woman,\x + \xo 4:16: \xt Exo 20:4; Lev 26:1; Deu 5:8; 27:15.\x*
\v 17 or of¦83709 any¦83710 animal¦83712 that's¦83713 on¦83722 the earth¦83714 or bird¦83718 that flies¦83721 in¦83722 the sky,\x + \xo 4:17-18a: \xt Rom 1:23.\x*
\v 18 or any \add ≈reptile\add* that¦83733 creeps¦83727 along the ground¦83728 or any fish¦83732 from¦83736 the deep \add ≈oceans\add*.
\v 19 Don't look up¦83741 to the sky and be¦83757 \add ≈tempted\add* to bow¦83758 down¦83758 to the sun¦83747 or the moon¦83750 or the stars¦83753 and serve them—your god¦83764 Yahweh¦83763 made them \add to serve\add* every¦83766 people¦83767 group \add ≈in the world\add*.
\v 20 Yahweh¦83775 has brought¦83776 you all out¦83776 of the¦83779 iron-smelting furnace¦83778 of Egypt¦83780 to be¦83781 a people¦83783 that¦83786 would belong to him¦83782 (as¦83785 you are today),\x + \xo 4:20: \xt Exo 19:5; Deu 7:6; 14:2; 26:18; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 2:9.\x*
\v 21 \add but\add* then¦83788 Yahweh¦83788 got angry¦83789 at¦83791 me¦83791 because of \add ≈your¦83811 parents\add* and¦83788 determined that I¦83798 would never enter the¦83801 land¦83807 that he's¦83796 giving¦83812 to¦83797 all of you.\x + \xo 4:21: \xt Num 20:12.\x*
\v 22 \add ≈Instead,\add* I'll die¦83818 here in this¦83820 place. I won't¦83821 cross¦83822 the¦83825 Yarden¦83825 river, but¦83826 you will¦83827, and¦83826 then you'll all take¦83828 possession¦83828 of¦83828 that¦83820 good¦83832 land¦83831.
\v 23 Take¦83835 \add great\add* care that you all don't forget¦83839 the agreement¦83842 with¦83847 your god Yahweh. Don't make¦83848 any idols for¦83849 yourselves in the form¦83851 of¦83851 anything¦83852 that your god Yahweh has¦83846 ordered¦83854 you all \add not to\add*,
\v 24 because¦83858 your¦83860 god Yahweh¦83859 is¦83861 a consuming¦83862 fire¦83861—he's a god who gets jealous¦83865.\x + \xo 4:24: \xt Heb 12:29.\x*
\p
\v 25 \add Even\add* after you've had children¦83871 and \add ≈grandchildren\add* and then grown¦83874 old¦83874 in the land, don't make an¦83878 idol in the form¦83879 of¦83879 anything¦83880, and don't be corrupt¦83876 or do¦83881 evil¦83882 \add things\add* that your¦83886 god¦83886 Yahweh¦83884 \add ≈dislikes and so which will¦83881 make him¦83887\add* angry.
\v 26 \add If you do\add*, I call¦83889 the heavens¦83894 and¦83895 the earth¦83897 as¦83889 witnesses¦83889 against¦83890 you all today, that you'd die \add over there\add* in¦83890 the land¦83904 that you're crossing the river to¦83912 possess¦83912. You wouldn't live¦83915 there very long¦83915, but¦83895 \add instead would end up\add* getting destroyed¦83919.
\v 27 Then¦83922 Yahweh¦83923 would scatter¦83922 \add ≈the remainder\add* among¦83925 the nations¦83929 where¦83930 \add ?≈you'd remain as a small minority\add*.\x + \xo 4:27-28: \xt Deu 28:36.\x*
\v 28 There¦83938 you would \add ?be forced to\add* worship gods¦83939 that¦83945 humans¦83942 have made out of¦83940 wood¦83943 or stone¦83944 and¦83936 which¦83945 can't¦83946 see¦83948, hear¦83950, smell¦83954, or eat¦83952.
\v 29 From¦83957 there¦83957 you'll search for your¦83961 god¦83961 Yahweh¦83960, and you'll find¦83962 him when you search for him with \add ≈determination and total¦83965 sincerity\add*.\x + \xo 4:29: \xt Jer 29:13.\x*
\v 30 \add ≈It's in the¦83979 future when you end¦83978 up in distress¦83972\add* \add there\add* that you'll¦83980 return¦83980 to your¦83984 god¦83984 Yahweh¦83983 and¦83985 listen¦83985 to \add ≈what he tells\add* \add you\add*,
\v 31 because¦83988 your god Yahweh¦83991 is¦83989 a merciful god. He¦83994 won't abandon¦83994 you or destroy¦83996 you, and¦83997 he won't forget¦83998 what he promised to¦84005 your ancestors¦84002.
\rem /s1 The Lord Is God; There Is Only One God
\p
\v 32 Now, please¦84010, consider past times before you were¦84015 alive, i.e., from¦84017 when¦84020 God¦84022 first created¦84021 people here on¦84025 the¦84019 earth¦84027. You could search \add ≈all through human¦84024 history and¦84028 you wouldn't find anything else as incredible¦84036\add* \add as what Yahweh has done for your ancestors\add*.
\v 33 \add ≈Has¦84052 any other people¦84043 group\add* heard¦84052 God¦84045 talking¦84046 from¦84047 the¦84047 middle¦84047 of¦84047 a fire¦84049 like you¦84052 have¦84052, and¦84054 then lived¦84054 \add to tell about it\add*?
\v 34 Or is their any other nation that¦84077 God¦84059 has¦84058 attempted¦84058 to¦84060 take¦84061 out from¦84064 the¦84064 middle of¦84064 another nation, using miracles¦84067 and war, and power and terrifying actions, like¦84076 your¦84084 god¦84082 Yahweh¦84081 did¦84079 for¦84080 you all¦84076 when you were in¦84066 Egypt¦84083?
\v 35 You¦84092 were¦84087 shown¦84087 \add all that\add* so you'd know¦84088 that Yahweh¦84090 is¦84093 \add ≈the¦84092 one and only\add* god.\x + \xo 4:35: \xt Mrk 12:32.\x*
\v 36 He¦84101 allowed you to hear¦84101 his voice¦84104 from the skies¦84100 to instruct you, and¦84106 on¦84106 earth¦84108 you heard¦84115 his words¦84114 from the incredible¦84113 fire¦84117 that he¦84101 \add ≈showed¦84109\add* you.
\v 37 Because¦84119 he loved¦84121 your¦84124 ancestors¦84124, he chose¦84125 their¦84126 \add ≈descendants¦84126\add* \add as his people\add* and used his \add power and strength to lead\add* you¦84128 out¦84128 of¦84130 Egypt¦84132
\v 38 \add and then\add* to¦84134 drive¦84134 out nations¦84135 ahead¦84139 of¦84139 you that were greater¦84136 and more¦84138 powerful than¦84138 you—bringing¦84140 you here today so that you could occupy their¦84146 land¦84146 as¦84148 your¦84139 inheritance¦84147.
\v 39 So¦84151 today you¦84151 should acknowledge¦84151 that¦84157 Yahweh¦84158 is¦84167 god of¦84156 the heavens¦84161 above¦84162 and the earth¦84165 below¦84166, and there's¦84167 no \add ≈other god\add*.
