\v 46 when they were in the valley¦84288 \add east\add* of the Yarden¦84287 \add River\add*. They¦84304 were across from¦84305 the town of Beyt¦84290-Peor¦84291, in the land¦84292 that¦84296 the Amorite¦84295 King¦84294 Sihon¦84293 (who¦84296 lived in Heshbon¦84298 \add city\add*) had ruled. (Mosheh¦84301 and¦84302 the \add other\add* \add ≈Israelis¦84303\add* had defeated¦84300 them when they came¦84304 out¦84304 of Egypt¦84305.)
