\r (Exo. 20:1-17)
\p
\v 1 Then¦84358 Mosheh¦84358 \add !(Moses¦84358)\add* \add ≈summoned\add* all¦84361 Yisrael and told them, “Yisrael, listen¦84366 to the instructions¦84370 and the regulations¦84370 that¦84374 I¦84375 will¦84379 speak¦84376 in¦84377 your¦84377 ears¦84377 today, and then you must¦84379 learn¦84379 them and be¦84376 careful¦84381 to follow¦84382 them.
\v 2 Our¦84385 god¦84385 Yahweh¦84384 made¦84386 an agreement¦84388 with¦84389 us¦84387 at¦84389 Horev¦84389 \add !(Mt¦84389. Sinai¦84389)\add*.
\v 3 \add *He¦84396\add* didn't make¦84395 that¦84400 agreement¦84399 with our¦84394 ancestors¦84394, but with us \add ourselves\add*—those¦84404 of¦84394 us here¦84405 today, \add i.e., with\add* \em living\em* people.
\v 4 Yahweh¦84414 spoke¦84413 to you from¦84417 the middle¦84417 of¦84417 the fire¦84418—face to face with¦84412 you all on¦84412 that mountain¦84416.
\v 5 \add Well,\add* \add ≈it was¦84421 me who\add* stood¦84421 between¦84422 all of¦84432 you and Yahweh at¦84426 that¦84427 time¦84426, to reveal Yahweh's¦84424 message¦84432 to you, because¦84434 you were¦84435 afraid¦84435 \add ≈to approach\add* the fire¦84437, and you all didn't¦84438 go¦84440 up¦84440 the mountain¦84441. \add Yahweh\add* said¦84442:
\p
\v 6 ‘I¦84445 am¦84446 your¦84447 god¦84447 Yahweh¦84446 who¦84448 brought¦84449 you¦84449 all out¦84449 of¦84447 Egypt¦84451—from the¦84450 slave-house¦84454 \add there\add*.
\li1
\v 7 \add ≈Don't have any other god¦84462, other than me.\add*
\li1
\v 8 Don't \add ≈carve\add* any¦84478 figure for¦84474 yourself¦84474 \add ≈that¦84482 looks like\add* anything in the sky or on¦84484 the ground, or in the water¦84495 below the ground.\x + \xo 5:8-9: \xt Lev 26:1; Deu 4:15-18; 27:15.\x*
\v 9 Don't¦84508 bow¦84504 down¦84504 to¦84506 them or \add ≈serve¦84509\add* them, because¦84511 I, your¦84514 god Yahweh¦84513, am¦84515 a jealous¦84516 god. I'll \add ≈punish the¦84518 descendants\add* of¦84518 those¦84529 who¦84529 hate¦84529 me¦84529, even for¦84506 three or four generations¦84525,\x + \xo 5:9-10: \xt Exo 34:6-7; Num 14:18; Deu 7:9-10.\x*
\v 10 \add ≈but¦84532\add* showing¦84532 loyal¦84534 commitment to¦84536 thousands¦84536 \add ≡of generations\add* of those¦84538 who¦84538 love¦84538 me¦84538 and¦84539 obey my¦84538 instructions.
