\v 11 Don't¦84556 use the¦84548 name¦84548 of¦84548 your¦84551 god¦84551 Yahweh¦84550 idly, because¦84553 \add *I¦84554\add* won't¦84544 \add ≈fail to punish people who¦84558 do that¦84558\add*.
\li1
\v 12 Observe the¦84571 Rest Day¦84571 \add on Saturday\add* to¦84578 sanctify it¦84578, as¦84578 your¦84585 god¦84585 Yahweh¦84583 commanded¦84581 you¦84581.\x + \xo 5:12: \xt Exo 16:23-30; 31:12-14.\x*
\v 13 There's six¦84589 days¦84591 for labouring¦84593 and¦84595 doing¦84595 all¦84597 your¦84600 work¦84600,
\v 14 \add ≈but¦84603\add* the¦84603 seventh¦84604 day is¦84606 a rest day \add dedicated\add* to¦84608 your god¦84610 Yahweh¦84608. Don't¦84612 do¦84613 any work¦84616 on¦84631 that¦84632 day: not¦84612 you or your children or your slaves, or \add using\add* any of¦84621 your cattle, nor any foreigner living \add ≈with¦84631 you\add*—your slaves can rest like¦84636 you.
\v 15 Remember¦84639 that you were¦84645 a slave¦84643 in¦84659 Egypt¦84649, and that your god Yahweh \add ≈took action and used my power\add* to take you out¦84651 of¦84671 there¦84657. Therefore¦84666 your god Yahweh commands¦84669 you to keep the¦84675 Rest Day¦84675.
\li1
\v 16 Honour¦84682 your father¦84685 and mother¦84688 as¦84689 your god Yahweh has¦84690 commanded¦84690 you, so that \add ≈you'll have a long¦84695 life\add* and \add ≈so that everything will go¦84698 well¦84698 in the¦84701 country\add* that your god Yahweh is¦84706 giving¦84706 you.\x + \xo 5:16: a \xt Deu 27:16; Mat 15:4; 19:19; Mrk 7:10; 10:19; Luk 18:20; Eph 6:2; \xo b \xt Eph 6:3.\x*
