\v 21 Don't¦84736 covet¦84737 your¦84752 neighbour's¦84752 \add ≈spouse\add*, or their house¦84743 or land, or their slaves or livestock, or \add ≈anything else that¦84751 they own\add*.’\x + \xo 5:21: \xt Rom 7:7; 13:9.\x*
