\p
\v 22 Yahweh¦84760 spoke¦84759 those words¦84757 in¦84766 a \add ≈booming\add* voice¦84771 from¦84767 the middle¦84767 of¦84767 the fire¦84768, the cloud¦84769, and the gloom, to all your assembly¦84765 on the mountain¦84766. \add ≈That was all he said\add*, and he wrote¦84775 \add @those instructions\add* on two¦84778 stone¦84780 tablets¦84779 and gave¦84781 them¦84781 to me.\x + \xo 5:22-27: \xt Heb 12:18-19.\x*
