\v 23 Then¦84784 when you heard¦84785 the voice¦84788 \add coming out\add* from¦84789 the darkness¦84790 and the mountain¦84791 was¦84792 blazing with¦84793 fire¦84793, then¦84784 all¦84796 the heads of¦84798 your¦84800 tribes¦84799 and the elders¦84800 approached¦84794 me¦84795
