\v 1 These are¦85020 the instructions¦85011 and rules and regulations¦85008 that your god¦85013 Yahweh¦85012 ordered¦85011 me to teach¦85014 you all, to do¦85016 in the land that you're about¦85020 to enter and occupy.
\v 2 \add *He¦85028\add* wants you all to honour him, to follow all his instructions¦85035, and to keep his rules that I'm¦85038 teaching you and your descendants so¦85048 that your time¦85046 \add on the land\add* will be¦85039 prolonged.
