\v 16 Don't¦85242 test¦85243 \add the patience of\add* your god¦85247 Yahweh¦85246 \add again\add* like you all did \add over water\add* at¦85250 Massah¦85250.\x + \xo 6:16: a \xt Mat 4:7; Luk 4:12; \xo b \xt Exo 17:1-7.\x*
