\v 19 driving¦85284 out¦85284 all¦85287 your¦85289 enemies¦85289 from¦85290 \add ≈that land\add* just¦85291 as¦85291 Yahweh¦85293 has¦85292 said.
\p
\v 20 \add ≈In the¦85303 future\add* when your¦85299 children¦85299 ask¦85298 you¦85298, ‘Why did our god¦85309 Yahweh¦85308 our god¦85309 command¦85307 us to¦85301 obey all these rules and¦85304 decrees¦85303?’
\v 21 then¦85312 you¦85312 can tell them, ‘We¦85315 were¦85315 Far-oh's slaves¦85314 in¦85317 Egypt¦85317, \add ≈but¦85312\add* Yahweh¦85319 \add ≈used his incredible power to¦85313 get us¦85318 out¦85318 of¦85313 there\add*.
