\r (Deu. 28:1-14)
\p
\v 12 \add ≈If you pay attention to these¦85623 instructions and always obey them¦85626\add*, then your god¦85629 Yahweh¦85628 will¦85620 keep¦85627 the¦85633 agreement¦85633 that¦85637 he¦85638 promised to your ancestors¦85639 and \add continue to display his\add* loyal¦85636 commitment to you,\x + \xo 7:12-16: \xt Deu 11:13-17.\x*
\v 13 and he will love¦85641 you and bless¦85642 you. \add ≈He'll¦85641 grant you many children and make your farming productive\add*, \add producing\add* grain¦85651 and \add ≈grapes for¦85666\add* wine¦85652, and \add olive\add* oil¦85653. Your¦85653 cattle¦85656 and sheep and goats will multiply¦85643 on¦85659 the¦85660 land that he promised your ancestors¦85664 that he'd give¦85665 you.
\v 14 You'll be blessed \add ≈more than any other people¦85672 group\add*. \add ≈All¦85670 of you¦85669 will be able to have children, and¦85678 all¦85670 of your¦85679 livestock¦85679 will produce offspring\add*.
\v 15 Yahweh¦85682 will¦85681 keep sickness¦85686 away from¦85683 you. All¦85687 those horrible diseases¦85689 that¦85692 \add @your¦85695 ancestors¦85695\add* saw in¦85698 Egypt¦85690 won't¦85694 affect you, but¦85681 \add instead\add* he'll¦85681 give them¦85695 to those who¦85700 hate¦85700 you.
\v 16 You¦85719 must¦85702 destroy all¦85705 the¦85707 peoples¦85707 that your¦85710 god¦85710 Yahweh¦85709 \add ≈gives you victory over\add*—\add ≈don't allow yourselves\add* to¦85711 pity¦85715 them¦85717, and¦85702 don't serve¦85719 their¦85722 gods¦85722 because¦85723 \add ≈that would¦85708 end¦85708 up¦85708 trapping¦85708 you\add*.
\p
