\v 5 Women mustn't \add ≈wear\add* men's clothes, and¦92369 men mustn't \add ≈wear\add* women's clothes. Your¦92378 god¦92378 Yahweh¦92377 \add ≈hates\add* \add ≈people who¦92381 do¦92381 things like\add* that¦92381.
