\v 52 They'll surround all your cities until¦95669 your high¦95672, fortified¦95673 walls¦95671 that¦95674 you trusted¦95676 in¦95677 come¦95670 down¦95670 all over your country. \add Yes,\add* you'll be¦95676 \add contained\add* inside your cities throughout the land¦95688 the your god¦95692 Yahweh¦95691 has¦95690 given¦95690 you.
\p
\v 53 Due to¦95705 that siege¦95708 and the distress¦95712 that you experience from the oppression of your enemies¦95714, you'll \add end up\add* eating¦95695 the flesh¦95699 of the sons¦95700 and daughters¦95701 that your god¦95707 Yahweh¦95706 has¦95703 given¦95703 you.
\v 54 Even the most sensitive¦95719, kind-hearted man¦95716 among¦95718 you¦95718 will¦95721 \add ≈be¦95721 selfish\add* towards his brother¦95723, towards the wife¦95724 \add ≈that¦95728 he loves\add*, and¦95726 towards his own remaining¦95729 children¦95727—
