\v 9 Your¦96774 god¦96759 Yahweh¦96758 will¦96757 give you prosperity in \add ≈everything you work¦96762 on¦96760\add*, and \add ≈in producing children\add*, and \add ≈expanding your herds\add* and \add ≈harvesting your crops\add*. \add *He'll¦96757\add* \add ≈happily¦96778 cause¦96778 you to¦96778 prosper¦96778 just¦96778 like¦96778 he'd¦96778 done¦96778\add* for¦96777 your fathers¦96783,
\v 10 if you listen¦96786 to \add *his\add* voice¦96787, following his instructions¦96792 and obeying his rules written¦96793 in¦96787 this¦96796 book¦96794, i.e., if you return¦96798 to your god¦96802 Yahweh¦96788 your God¦96789 with \add ≈total¦96803 sincerity\add* and with all¦96806 your \add ≈energy\add*.
\s1 Yahweh's instructions aren't a distant dream
